## Problem classes

### `Trusted peer lost trust after a rescan`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `trusted` flipped false and the session disappeared | Fingerprint or TLS cert pin mismatched on upsert | Keep the identity-changed path. Do not auto-retrust. The user re-accepts. |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-10 -->

### `Home Wi-Fi password in the database`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Passphrase readable with `sqlite3` | Column or settings key holds the secret | Move the secret to the platform secure store. Drift keeps SSID and `wpa2-psk` / `wpa3-sae` only. |

